      "label": "Captain Default Look - Crinkled Oilskin",
      "clothing_id": "clothing_be371886ad8a",
      "appearance_description": "Photorealistic middle-aged fisherman standing on a small wooden fishing boat deck at dusk. Weathered tanned skin with deep wrinkles and visible pores, short grey-brown hair slicked back, trimmed salt-and-pepper stubble, strong jawline, small faded scar on left cheekbone, sun-weathered red patches on nose and ears. Solid compact build, broad shoulders. Wears a plain dark navy oilskin jacket with a simple stand-collar standing open at the neck (fabric collar only, not a foldable hood), the crinkled creased waxed-cotton fabric showing natural folds, white salt-streak residue and lighter tan elbow patches; a thick braided hemp rope belt with a small brass buckle at the waist (no fob, no pendant); dark oil-stained work trousers; worn brown leather boots. Wind-blown, golden-hour sea light, cinematic film still, realistic skin and fabric texture, no cartoon or game look.",
      "appearance_delta": "The oilskin jacket must show HEAVY visible CRINKLED waxed-cotton creases and folds across the entire surface (like dry-painted crinkled fabric, NOT smooth, NOT leather-like), with white salt-streak residue and lighter tan elbow patches at both elbows. The collar is a PLAIN simple stand-collar standing open — ABSOLUTELY NO HODD, NO foldable hood, no hanging fob or pendant. Rope belt with a single small brass buckle. Dark navy oilskin. One person standing alone on a weathered fishing boat deck at golden-hour dusk. Realistic cinematic live-action film still.",
