      "label": "Fishing Boat Exterior - Empty Crew-Free",
      "clothing_id": null,
      "appearance_description": "Completely empty, crew-free, unmanned small weathered motorized fishing boat, sitting ALONE on a calm open sea at golden-hour dusk. ABSOLUTELY NO PEOPLE IN THIS ENTIRE IMAGE. No human, no person, no man, no woman, no captain, no crew member, no fisherman, no standing figure, no silhouette on the horizon, no one at the wheel, no one on the deck, no one in the water, zero living beings. Only the boat, the water, and the air. Hull: deeply faded, dulled, desaturated navy blue on the lower half, heavy rust-brown gunwale with rust patches, pale grey deck with chipped paint, salt-stain streaks and rope abrasion. Low freeboard, pointed bow, flat raked stern. Fixed layout: the pointed BOW (front) holds coiled fishing net, wooden crates and a small winch; the flat raked STERN (rear) holds the open, empty, unmanned piloting area with a wooden ship's wheel, an oil-stained bench seat, a small instrument panel, and a single thin mast with rigging and a small antenna. A thick plume of black exhaust smoke rises from the stern motor into the air. Three-quarter cinematic wide shot from water level, the empty boat the sole subject, calm golden-hour sea. Photorealistic maritime film still, realistic texture, no cartoon, no game look, no human, no people, no person.",
